OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 24 JAN
OL,4,G1700FThis Classical Life
OL,5,     GJess Gillam meets pianist Ivana
OL,6,     GGavric to share their favourite
OL,7,     Gtracks from Janacek, Caroline
OL,8,     GShaw, Jimi Hendrix and Artie Shaw.
OL,9,G1800FOpera on 3
OL,10,     GLive from the Met, Gershwin's
OL,11,     Gfusion of opera, jazz and
OL,12,     GBroadway, Porgy and Bess,
OL,13,     Gstarring Alfred Walker and
OL,14,     GBrittany Renee.
OL,15,G2145FMusic Planet
OL,16,     GKathryn Tickell selects music
OL,17,     Gfrom around the globe, and
OL,18,     GScottish singer Julie Fowlis
OL,19,     Gshares a Return Journey in two
OL,20,     Gtracks: one for the road, and one
OL,21,     Gthat reminds her of home.
