OL,4,G2230FNew Music Show
OL,5,     GItalian composer Silvia Tarozzi
OL,6,     Gshares her essential listening
OL,7,     Gwith Kate Molleson. Plus more
OL,8,     Gfrom Latvia's Skanu mezs festival.
OL,9,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,10,     GMahler's haunting Ruckert Lieder
OL,11,     Gwith Latvian mezzo-soprano Elina
OL,12,     GGaranca feature in this concert
OL,13,     Gfrom Switzerland, alongside
OL,14,     GMahler's Tenth Symphony and
OL,15,     GBoulez's Memoriale.
